*     FAP                                                                       
       LBL     DSQRT                                                    DSQRT000
       COUNT   60                                                       DSQRT001
*      U. OF CHICAGO VERSION OF DOUBLE PRECISION SQUARE ROOT            DSQRT002
*              NORMALIZED ARGUMENT MUST BE GIVEN IN CELLS 32767, 32766. DSQRT003
*              ANSWER APPEARS IN THE SAME CELLS                         DSQRT004
       SPACE                                                            DSQRT005
       ENTRY   DSQRT                                                    DSQRT006
       SPACE                                                            DSQRT007
 DSQRT DLD     4)-1                                                     DSQRT008
       XCA                                                              DSQRT009
       TZE     1,4                                                      DSQRT010
       STI     SVIND                                                    DSQRT011
   A   DST     ARG                                                      DSQRT012
       TMI     ERROR                                                    DSQRT013
       ANA     K1            1ST APPROXIMATION IS MADE AS FOLLOWS       DSQRT014
       ARS     1               BETWEEN 1/2 AND 1, BY LINE PASSING THRU  DSQRT015
       ADD     ARG               3/4 AND 1                              DSQRT016
       ARS     1               BETWEEN 1/4 AND 1/2 BY LINE PASSING THRU DSQRT017
       ADD     K2                1/2 AND 3/4                            DSQRT018
       SPACE                                                            DSQRT019
       SXA     SAVE,4                                                   DSQRT020
       AXT     3,4                                                      DSQRT021
 LOOP  STO     BUFF          THREE PASSES OF NEWTON RAPHSON LOOP IN     DSQRT022
       CLA     ARG             SINGLE PRECISION                         DSQRT023
       FDP     BUFF                                                     DSQRT024
       XCA                                                              DSQRT025
       FAD     BUFF                                                     DSQRT026
       SUB     K1                                                       DSQRT027
       TIX     LOOP,4,1                                                 DSQRT028
       DST     BUFF          ONE MORE PASS OF NEWTON RAPHSON LOOP,      DSQRT029
       DLD     ARG             THIS TIME IN DOUBLE PRECISION            DSQRT030
       DFDP    BUFF                                                     DSQRT031
       DFAD    BUFF                                                     DSQRT032
       SUB     K1                                                       DSQRT033
       XCA                                                              DSQRT034
       SUB     K1                                                       DSQRT035
       DST     4)-1                                                     DSQRT036
 SAVE  AXT     **,4                                                     DSQRT037
       LDI     SVIND                                                    DSQRT038
       TRA     1,4                                                      DSQRT039
       SPACE                                                            DSQRT040
 ERROR LDI     *+2                                                      DSQRT041
       TRA*    $(EXE)                                                   DSQRT042
       PZE     2,7,*+1                                                  DSQRT043
       DLD     ARG                                                      DSQRT044
       SSP                                                              DSQRT045
       TRA     A                                                        DSQRT046
       SPACE                                                            DSQRT047
  K1   OCT     1000000000                                               DSQRT048
  K2   OCT     100400000000                                             DSQRT049
 SVIND BSS     1                                                        DSQRT050
       EVEN                                                             DSQRT051
  ARG  BSS     2                                                        DSQRT052
 BUFF  BSS     2                                                        DSQRT053
  4)   EQU     32767                                                    DSQRT054
       END                                                              DSQRT055
